No warranty. This mount is not crash-tested and is not a certified restraint
or OEM accessory. On the default model the arms reach about 222 mm forward of
the headrest face and the cradle stands about 114 mm above the block bottoms.
The default collar is 33 mm thick along the post, 25.5 mm outside, with a
14.5 mm bore for a 14 mm post (0.5 mm clearance). A different measured
post_od needs a new coupon and new blocks. See README.md.
